title: Brand login page on free hosting
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, brand-impersonation, free-hosting
attack: T1583.006, T1656
description: A page on a free hosting or site-builder platform has a brand and login,
  wallet, support or verification wording in its title. Example platforms: pages.dev,
  typedream.app, web.app, blob.core.windows.net. These are the SEO and smishing landing
  pages that send victims to a harvester.
---
// The brand page the capture imitates most has a brand login or wallet title and sits on
// a free hosting tenant that is not allowlisted.
brand_claim
| where free_hosting_lure == true
| project brand, confidence, url, evidence
